1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 24]
[Finale]

34
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:07,680
Pei Zhao, watch out.

35
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,360
Qingyan. Zhao.

36
00:02:09,870 --> 00:02:11,190
You're brothers.

37
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:13,120
Why kill each other?

38
00:02:20,150 --> 00:02:21,280
Qingyan, if you blame me,

39
00:02:21,750 --> 00:02:23,520
then blame me. Blame your mother.

40
00:02:23,870 --> 00:02:24,840
Stop fighting.

41
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:49,430
Qingyan.

42
00:02:50,430 --> 00:02:51,280
Qingyan, what's wrong?

43
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:53,870
Are you all right?

44
00:02:56,470 --> 00:02:57,150
Zhao.

45
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,190
How could you hit him so hard?

46
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:01,800
Qingyan.

47
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,310
My dear Mother Consort.

48
00:03:13,030 --> 00:03:15,240
What a good father you gave me.

49
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:25,520
You.

50
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,120
This is all your fault.

51
00:03:27,870 --> 00:03:29,630
You made them turn on each other

52
00:03:30,630 --> 00:03:32,360
and ruined the Blood Jade Ritual.

53
00:03:34,030 --> 00:03:34,960
I'll kill you.

54
00:03:35,710 --> 00:03:36,840
I'll kill you.

55
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,590
Qingyan.

56
00:03:52,430 --> 00:03:53,430
Why did you do that?

57
00:03:57,710 --> 00:03:58,280
Qingyan.

58
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,310
This is pointless.

59
00:04:02,310 --> 00:04:03,520
Eighteen years.

60
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,630
Father never loved me.

61
00:04:05,630 --> 00:04:06,280
You never claimed me.

62
00:04:07,470 --> 00:04:09,240
In Qian Palace,

63
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,870
you kept the clothes you made for him,

64
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:14,430
guarding his tablet day and night.

65
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:17,680
The moment you learned
Pei Zhao was your son,

66
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:19,360
you couldn't wait to...

67
00:04:20,950 --> 00:04:22,480
I only felt I owed him.

68
00:04:22,950 --> 00:04:24,360
That's why I spoke of him more.

69
00:04:24,870 --> 00:04:26,120
You're the one I love most.

70
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:30,750
Yun Shao.

71
00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:35,380
[Chawu Incense]

72
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:52,070
I'm giving it back.

73
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:55,040
I never wanted the throne that badly.

74
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,070
I just couldn't accept it.

75
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,190
How infuriating.

76
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:06,270
To die before you, of all things.

77
00:05:12,750 --> 00:05:13,560
Qingyan.

78
00:05:14,390 --> 00:05:15,190
Qingyan.

79
00:05:15,830 --> 00:05:16,920
Qingyan.

80
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,430
Qingyan.

81
00:05:47,860 --> 00:05:48,700
[Imperial Edict]

82
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:51,240
The Late Emperor's Edict.

83
00:05:52,070 --> 00:05:53,430
Princess Yun Shao,

84
00:05:53,830 --> 00:05:56,160
favored by Heaven's mandate,

85
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,310
blessed by ancestral grace.

86
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:02,510
Our nation once faced grave peril.

87
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,750
Treacherous men sowed chaos

88
00:06:05,070 --> 00:06:06,720
and brought misery upon the people.

89
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,950
By the protection of the divine,

90
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,950
and the loyalty of our warriors,

91
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:15,870
the rebels have been vanquished,

92
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:18,040
and peace restored to all the land.

93
00:06:18,870 --> 00:06:21,270
With rites paid at the Ancestral Temple,

94
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:23,120
she ascends the imperial throne,

95
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,360
proclaiming the era of Zhaode,

96
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,000
to proclaim a new age.

97
00:06:27,750 --> 00:06:29,720
Grand celebration throughout the realm.

98
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,750
Abolish slavery and purge corruption.

99
00:06:32,070 --> 00:06:33,920
Honor the loyal and the martyred.

100
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:36,040
Reward meritorious service.

101
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:40,120
Third Day of the First Month,
Year One of Zhaode.

102
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:18,480
- Long live Her Majesty.
- Long live Her Majesty.

103
00:07:26,420 --> 00:07:29,860
[Imperial Proclamation]

104
00:07:30,210 --> 00:07:31,270
By decree of the new sovereign,

105
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,070
the Wingless system is abolished.

106
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:35,800
All people shall share
in this age of peace.

107
00:07:36,870 --> 00:07:39,530
- Wonderful.
- That's wonderful.

108
00:07:39,750 --> 00:07:41,000
After a joint trial
by the Three Judicial Offices,

109
00:07:41,310 --> 00:07:42,800
the Yun clan is found guilty
of plotting against the princess,

110
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:43,920
slaughtering innocents,

111
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:44,800
and corruption and abuse of law.

112
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,160
Their crimes are beyond all pardon.

113
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,240
Yun Zhanpeng and his wife

114
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:48,000
are sentenced to death.

115
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,680
Yun Heng is banished from the capital

116
00:07:49,870 --> 00:07:50,750
and may never return.

117
00:07:50,750 --> 00:07:52,000
They fed on the blood of our daughters.

118
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:52,800
They deserve to die.

119
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:53,310
Exactly.

120
00:07:53,310 --> 00:07:54,430
We should drink their blood too.

121
00:07:54,430 --> 00:07:55,190
Eat their flesh.

122
00:07:55,190 --> 00:07:55,920
- Right.
- Exactly.

123
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,770
That's what they deserve.

124
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,240
You're a woman.

125
00:09:18,630 --> 00:09:19,170
Remember,

126
00:09:19,350 --> 00:09:20,790
stay out of court affairs.

127
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:22,320
Back then,

128
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,720
Aunt awed the realm with one song

129
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,790
and became the Noble Consort.

130
00:09:27,150 --> 00:09:29,240
If she can make the Yun family proud,

131
00:09:29,510 --> 00:09:30,030
so can I.

132
00:09:30,150 --> 00:09:31,720
I fought hard

133
00:09:31,730 --> 00:09:33,320
to step outside.

134
00:10:19,100 --> 00:10:20,480
You're adopting sons?

135
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:22,720
If only Qi were still here.

136
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,630
If I were a man,

137
00:10:24,910 --> 00:10:26,750
I'd achieve far more than him.

138
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,390
I study day and night

139
00:10:29,390 --> 00:10:31,200
so that one day

140
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:33,240
I could do the same.

141
00:10:35,090 --> 00:10:37,790
Every Yun is born with that duty.

142
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:07,150
Qingyan. Zhao.

143
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:08,840
Look what I made for you.

144
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,510
Little dolls.

145
00:11:12,270 --> 00:11:13,840
This one is red.

146
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,600
This one is blue.

147
00:11:19,790 --> 00:11:21,150
Qingyan, which color do you like?

148
00:11:22,390 --> 00:11:22,910
She's gone mad.

149
00:11:22,910 --> 00:11:24,160
Then blue for Qingyan.

150
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:26,030
- She's Lord Pei's birth mother.
- Red for Zhao, okay?

151
00:11:27,150 --> 00:11:27,510
We...

152
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:28,140
Come here.

153
00:11:28,610 --> 00:11:29,380
Come to Mother.

154
00:11:29,670 --> 00:11:30,440
Have you found Lord Pei?

155
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:32,210
I have lots of treats for you.

156
00:11:32,750 --> 00:11:34,120
We have no idea where he went.

157
00:11:35,700 --> 00:11:37,130
I miss you so much.

158
00:11:37,910 --> 00:11:38,320
We found him.

159
00:11:38,910 --> 00:11:39,480
We found Lord Pei.

160
00:12:06,910 --> 00:12:07,480
Chang'an.

161
00:12:10,510 --> 00:12:11,000
You've done well.

162
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:14,540
[Tomb of Younger Brother, Ji Chang'an
Dedicated by Yun Shao]

163
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:35,270
Chang'an.

164
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:38,200
With your talent,

165
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:40,240
one day

166
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,750
you'll be Commander.

167
00:12:44,030 --> 00:12:44,600
Today,

168
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:46,440
I give this

169
00:12:47,510 --> 00:12:47,910
to you.

170
00:12:47,910 --> 00:12:48,500
[Commander of the Fengyi Guard]

171
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:55,440
Women who can't have you

172
00:12:55,790 --> 00:12:56,550
look at you

173
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:57,510
the same way.

174
00:12:59,630 --> 00:13:00,240
Give me back.

175
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,240
How fair of you.

176
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,030
Thank you, sir.

177
00:13:03,550 --> 00:13:04,000
Here.

178
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:06,270
Our gallant hero.

179
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:07,600
Next time, cover your tracks better.

180
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,360
So you found my pendant.

181
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:11,150
Madam Yun made this herself.

182
00:13:11,390 --> 00:13:12,270
I can't lose it.

183
00:13:25,750 --> 00:13:26,510
Why are you here?

184
00:13:29,270 --> 00:13:30,240
The new reign just began.

185
00:13:31,630 --> 00:13:32,480
You have so much to do.

186
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:34,960
Why won't you come see me?

187
00:13:35,910 --> 00:13:36,600
I've been

188
00:13:37,150 --> 00:13:37,870
busy lately.

189
00:13:37,870 --> 00:13:38,480
Liar.

190
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,030
You're afraid to see me.

191
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:43,200
I'm not.

192
00:13:45,270 --> 00:13:46,200
Stand up and speak.

193
00:13:50,270 --> 00:13:51,360
Don't turn your back on me.

194
00:14:05,750 --> 00:14:06,910
I know what's bothering you.

195
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,200
But it doesn't bother me.

196
00:14:11,670 --> 00:14:12,790
Ruoli has already left

197
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:14,270
to search for the cure.

198
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:16,870
The world is full of capable people.

199
00:14:17,790 --> 00:14:19,870
Someone can remove the mother-child Gu.

200
00:14:23,870 --> 00:14:24,670
You trust me,

201
00:14:25,550 --> 00:14:26,030
don't you?

202
00:14:52,790 --> 00:14:53,840
I picked one for you too.

203
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:56,790
Mine was handmade.

204
00:15:01,210 --> 00:15:04,050
♪Moonlight sways, flowers scent the air♪

205
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:05,550
That day, when I broke the bracelet,

206
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:08,910
it hurt me too.

207
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:11,840
Later, I picked up every bead.

208
00:15:14,810 --> 00:15:18,080
♪Fengyi blades lie hidden in the dark♪

209
00:15:18,370 --> 00:15:21,650
♪For one moment, all is lost to love♪

210
00:15:22,170 --> 00:15:27,760
♪Your blade stands shielding by my side♪

211
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:28,910
I was watching you the whole time.

212
00:15:30,510 --> 00:15:31,440
I was just angry.

213
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:33,480
Why didn't you tell me anything?

214
00:15:34,650 --> 00:15:38,670
♪To memories past♪

215
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,390
Will you return to the palace with me?

216
00:15:45,690 --> 00:15:49,200
♪Meetings and partings...♪

217
00:15:49,750 --> 00:15:50,480
My father,

218
00:15:51,150 --> 00:15:51,670
mother,

219
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,080
and brother

220
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:55,080
all committed grave crimes.

221
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,270
My staying at court

222
00:15:57,960 --> 00:15:58,600
does you no good,

223
00:15:59,670 --> 00:16:00,750
nor the Fengyi Bureau.

224
00:16:01,750 --> 00:16:02,440
You're who you are.

225
00:16:03,550 --> 00:16:04,550
You're nothing like them.

226
00:16:10,670 --> 00:16:11,270
Yun Shao.

227
00:16:13,230 --> 00:16:14,000
Look at the sun.

228
00:16:16,050 --> 00:16:16,670
It's about to set.

229
00:16:16,670 --> 00:16:19,570
♪Who is singing softly in my heart?♪

230
00:16:19,670 --> 00:16:20,240
Yes.

231
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,240
But tomorrow,

232
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:26,270
it'll rise again.

233
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:30,130
♪Fengyi blades lie hidden in the dark♪

234
00:16:31,130 --> 00:16:32,320
I'll watch the sunrise with you.

235
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:35,240
Day after day,

236
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:36,550
year after year.

237
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:50,610
♪The crescent moon binds me
to memories past♪

238
00:16:50,910 --> 00:16:57,360
♪Endless bonds,
a mountain we cannot pass♪

239
00:16:57,780 --> 00:17:01,170
♪Meetings and partings...♪

240
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:02,240
Pei Zhao.

241
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,000
Don't be afraid.

242
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:11,250
♪We shared the storm,
yet cannot cut the ties♪

243
00:17:11,430 --> 00:17:18,110
♪Winds rise, tossing time into chaos♪

244
00:17:18,250 --> 00:17:24,770
♪Love winds around our vows♪

245
00:17:27,180 --> 00:17:28,450
[The rite ends. Fengyi shines again.]

246
00:17:28,450 --> 00:17:30,020
[All is settled.
Thank you for the journey.]

247
00:17:30,030 --> 00:17:31,500
[Worth the wait and meeting.
Until we meet again.]

248
00:17:32,060 --> 00:17:35,500
[The End]

249
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:47,370
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

250
00:17:48,990 --> 00:17:52,180
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

251
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:55,240
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

252
00:17:55,740 --> 00:18:00,180
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

253
00:18:02,340 --> 00:18:05,010
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

254
00:18:06,230 --> 00:18:11,240
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

255
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:19,590
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

256
00:18:19,860 --> 00:18:28,480
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

257
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:37,150
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

258
00:18:37,530 --> 00:18:46,400
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

259
00:18:46,830 --> 00:18:55,320
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
